<Grid
  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
<Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
    </Grid.RowDefinitions>
    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="10"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
	<!--TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Text="1985-8-18" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}"/-->
	<TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}">
		IMMEDIATE
		<LineBreak/>
		O 11 1900Z FEB 88
	</TextBlock>
    <!--TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Text="05:00Z (06:00L)" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}"/-->

    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="FM"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="RED BANNER PACIFIC FLEET"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="TO"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="CO {TaskForceName}"/>
	<TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="INFO"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}">
		10th OPERATIONAL SQN
	</TextBlock>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="SUBJ"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="OPERATIONAL ORDER"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="9" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" TextWrapping="Wrap">
		SECRET
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		1. (S) {TaskForceName} is to interdict enemy convoys in the Northern Pacific. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		2. (S) Enemy submerged assets concentrated near Japanese mainland and not expected in this AO. Friendly interceptors from Petropavlovsk-Kamchatsky denying enemy air cover in this AO. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		3a. (S) National technical means indicate 1x large convoy East and 1x small convoy South of your position. Expected course and location of convoys marked on map. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>3b. (S) Southern convoy possibly contains 1x SPRUANCE-Class DD and additional ASW escorts. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>3c. (S) Eastern convoy possibly contains 1x CG, 1-2x DDG and additional ASW escorts. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		4. (S) Neutral traffic expected light and possibly transiting in groups. Hostile merchant traffic not expected to be in shipping lanes; all isolated hostile merchants sunk or withdrawn to convoy assembly areas. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>5. (S) {TaskForceName} is to transit to Petropavlovsk-Kamchatsky for rest and replenishment post-mission. Happy Hunting, Comrade.
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		SIGNED: Khvatov
		<LineBreak/>
		KTOF
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		SECRET
		<LineBreak/>
		DECL OADR BT
	  </TextBlock>
</Grid>